# Deploy scripts are consumed by cmd (deploy.bat) and Windows PowerShell 5.1.
# Batch files with LF line endings misparse inside parenthesized blocks on
# Windows cmd - the server's deploy.bat [4.6/5] repeatedly reported
# DATABASE_OWNER_URL as "not defined" although the key existed, with LF line
# endings the prime suspect (issue #47). Pin both to CRLF so a checkout
# (git pull on the server) can never reintroduce LF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
